# Shared USE defaults for every gentoozinho profile. Both vm and desktop
# already inherit gentoo's targets/desktop (X, dbus, opengl, wayland, pipewire,
# vulkan, bluetooth, gtk, qt6, ...), so only what that target lacks goes here,
# and only flags declared global in use.desc. Per-package flags live in
# package.use; anything a profile cannot carry is written to /etc/portage by
# install.sh.
USE="networkmanager dist-kernel"
